# The ai's Arc Lightning divides 3 damage: 2 to Grizzly Bears, 1 to Hill
# Giant (CR 601.2d). The human Unsummons the Bears in response. CR 608.2b:
# the Bears are no longer a legal target and their share goes with them
# (TargetChoices.java:71-82) -- Hill Giant is dealt only its own 1, not the
# whole 3, and survives.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 R
tapformana ai 3 R
tapformana ai 4 R
tapformana human 10 U
queue targets 5,6
queue divide 2,1
queue targets 5
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue action ai cast 1
queue action human cast 9
passpriority
